# tools/models - the present must load, not just exist.
#
# precache_model() is what parses a studio model, so a non-zero index here means
# ReHLDS's Mod_LoadModel accepted the file we generated.
\[CS16TEST\] init
\[CS16TEST\] tick
\[MDLTEST\] precache model=models/winterfest/present\.mdl index=[1-9][0-9]*
\[MDLTEST\] spawned ent=[1-9][0-9]* modelindex=[1-9][0-9]* frames=1 bone0=1
\[MDLTEST\] done rehlds=1

# ... and nothing anywhere complained about the model.
!Mod_LoadModel
!Host_Error
!not precached
!couldn't load
!bad version
!Run time error
!bad load
